{title: Tumhi Ho Maata Pita Tumhi Ho}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Tum hi ho mata pita tum hi ho
[Am] [G] [F] [Am],        Tum hi ho bandhu sakha tum hi ho
[Am],        Tum hi ho sathi tumhi sahare
[D] [A] [Am],        Koi na apna siva tumhare
[Am],        Tum hi ho naiya tum hi khevaiya
[Am] [G] [F] [Am],        Tum hi ho bandhu sakha tum hi ho
[Am],        Jo khil sake na vo ful ham hai
[D] [A] [Am],        Tumhare charno ki dhul ham hai
[A],        Daya ki drishti sadahi rakhna
[Am] [G] [F] [Am],        Tum hi ho bandhu sakha tum hi ho
